UID:c4ec5c14a0a02e433b6429d8d109d266@songbyrddc.com
DESCRIPTION:Unity for the Outcasts is a cyberpunk girl metal band from was
 hington dc blending together elements of pop\, electronic\, and metalcore 
 to create a unique spacey soundspace. the band writes music to give a voic
 e to those unheard\, striving to bring people together. featuring members 
 of Hispanic and South Asian descent\, Unity for the Outcasts aims to bring
  diversity and representation to the underepresented communities in the ro
 ck scene. Unity for the Outcasts is Diana (vocals)\, Andrew (drums)\, Sid 
 (bass)\, Andrew (lead guitar)\, and Samrat (rhythm guitar). \\*\\*\\* Spil
 t Milk is an up and coming band that is worth crying over. Falling somewhe
 re between Green Day and Queens of the Stone Age\, the Baltimore act draws
  on those punk and garage rock roots to light up the stage and ensnare you
 r eardrums. \\*\\*\\* RenRiot is an alt-rock/grunge-punk band from Washing
 ton\, DC.\, channeling raw emotion through honest lyrics and unapologetic 
 energy and evoking nostalgic feelings through a new sound. What began as R
 en’s (Vocals/Guitar) solo project grew into a full-force collaboration f
 eaturing Solana (Drums) and Dre (Bass). Together\, they have entered the s
 cene with a fresh sound and look - inviting the community to explore what 
 exists beyond arbitrary boundaries.
LOCATION:Songbyrd\, 540 Penn St NE\, Washington\, DC 20002\, USA
