 st\, Penny Meth\, the band shares the wealth of genres and influential art
 ists that shaped them. “We like indie rock\, but we also love dance pop\
 , and we also love really emo stuff and we also love shoegaze\,” says Cl
 ine\, singer and guitarist of the group. “I think the inspiration for ou
 r sound was like\, ‘How can we really cover all this ground?’”
